      "end_ms": 32280,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 144,
      "token_end_index": 148
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. And I'll send it out to you again, sort of.",
      "start_ms": 32520,
      "end_ms": 36720,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 148,
      "token_end_index": 165
    },
    {
      "text": " Was there anything else we wanted to add to the timeline? I mean, essentially, it was what, like, you can't see either right there. Here's the old one.",
